00:20:16,240 --> 00:20:18,000
(Stargazing room, city date)
more time alone with you.

576
00:20:18,260 --> 00:20:19,700
(Unlocked by them)
Suddenly, I'm not tired anymore.

577
00:20:20,720 --> 00:20:22,240
When I really like someone,

578
00:20:22,240 --> 00:20:23,240
I'm kind of like a kid.

579
00:20:23,640 --> 00:20:25,080
I got you a gift.

580
00:20:25,080 --> 00:20:26,680
I hope that around me,

581
00:20:26,680 --> 00:20:28,640
you can let your inner child out.

582
00:20:29,280 --> 00:20:30,120
Being with everyone

583
00:20:30,120 --> 00:20:31,360
or being alone with me,

584
00:20:31,360 --> 00:20:32,880
which feels more relaxing?

585
00:20:32,880 --> 00:20:33,920
Definitely when it's just us.

586
00:20:35,560 --> 00:20:36,760
I trust myself.

587
00:20:36,760 --> 00:20:37,760
And I trust you.

588
00:20:39,560 --> 00:20:40,560
Here's the wishing pool (wishing well).

589
00:20:40,880 --> 00:20:42,860
(Brand-new feature)
This is a new feature this season.

590
00:20:42,880 --> 00:20:43,920
Each cast member

591
00:20:43,920 --> 00:20:44,600
gets

592
00:20:44,960 --> 00:20:46,800
(Three coins)
only three

593
00:20:46,800 --> 00:20:47,880
Master Kong Jasmine Coins all season.

594
00:20:47,880 --> 00:20:49,400
Once they're gone, they're gone.

595
00:20:51,000 --> 00:20:52,160
I think it's this one.

596
00:20:52,840 --> 00:20:54,560
Look at these two helpers.

597
00:20:54,560 --> 00:20:55,600
Let's each take one stretch.

598
00:20:55,600 --> 00:20:56,480
No need to be polite.

599
00:20:56,480 --> 00:20:57,280
Okay, then I won't...

600
00:20:57,280 --> 00:20:58,800
I won't hold back, then.

601
00:20:58,800 --> 00:20:59,200
Right.

602
00:20:59,200 --> 00:20:59,960
I'll carry it for the first stretch.

603
00:20:59,960 --> 00:21:00,720
Then you take the second.

604
00:21:00,720 --> 00:21:02,240
Give it to me when we reach the stairs.

605
00:21:02,240 --> 00:21:02,760
Sure.

606
00:21:03,120 --> 00:21:03,920
The second stretch is shorter.

607
00:21:03,920 --> 00:21:05,400
You're so thoughtful.

608
00:21:05,400 --> 00:21:05,840
It's fine.

609
00:21:06,080 --> 00:21:06,960
So fair.

610
00:21:10,120 --> 00:21:11,720
Thank you so much.

611
00:21:11,720 --> 00:21:12,560
No problem.

612
00:21:12,560 --> 00:21:14,320
Thanks for bringing everyone groceries.

613
00:21:18,120 --> 00:21:19,800
Someone else just got off work.

614
00:21:26,300 --> 00:21:27,780
(Cui Yihang arrives)
Cui Yihang.

615
00:21:31,400 --> 00:21:31,880
Hi.

616
00:21:31,880 --> 00:21:32,960
Cui Yihang.

617
00:21:33,500 --> 00:21:34,480
(Sun Qimeng arrives)

618
00:21:34,480 --> 00:21:35,740
(Cao Yiheng arrives)
Everyone's moved in.

619
00:21:35,760 --> 00:21:38,000
Hi.

620
00:21:38,000 --> 00:21:39,920
We're playing pool. Want to join?

621
00:21:39,920 --> 00:21:40,280
Sure.

622
00:21:44,200 --> 00:21:45,560
You've got some skills.

623
00:21:45,560 --> 00:21:46,680
Nice.

624
00:21:47,440 --> 00:21:48,720
I brought breakfast for everyone.

625
00:21:48,720 --> 00:21:49,760
Since I got here pretty late,

626
00:21:49,760 --> 00:21:51,080
I thought

627
00:21:51,080 --> 00:21:52,160
I'd bring everyone breakfast.

628
00:21:52,160 --> 00:21:53,800
You can grab it
on your way out tomorrow.

629
00:21:53,800 --> 00:21:55,680
Okay, thank you so much.

630
00:21:55,680 --> 00:21:56,480
I saw it.

631
00:21:56,480 --> 00:21:57,440
That's so thoughtful.

632
00:21:57,740 --> 00:21:58,400
(Sun Bohan arrives)

633
00:21:58,400 --> 00:21:59,040
Sun Bohan.

634
00:22:01,780 --> 00:22:02,980
(Hurries out to greet him)
Hi.

635
00:22:03,280 --> 00:22:03,720
Hi.

636
00:22:04,680 --> 00:22:05,880
Hi.

637
00:22:06,320 --> 00:22:07,040
Hi.

638
00:22:07,640 --> 00:22:08,320
Have you eaten?

639
00:22:09,600 --> 00:22:10,640
I'm good.

640
00:22:10,640 --> 00:22:11,320
I'm not that hungry.

641
00:22:11,410 --> 00:22:12,340
Who are we still waiting for?

642
00:22:13,600 --> 00:22:15,000
Only three girls are here.

643
00:22:15,000 --> 00:22:15,920
Only three?

644
00:22:16,160 --> 00:22:16,840
We're still waiting for Cui Kaiyi.

645
00:22:16,840 --> 00:22:17,240
Cui Kaiyi.

646
00:22:17,520 --> 00:22:18,440
And Sha Yue'er isn't here yet.

647
00:22:18,900 --> 00:22:20,420
(Sha Yue'er arrives)

648
00:22:24,720 --> 00:22:25,440
Hi.

649
00:22:26,740 --> 00:22:27,620
(Turns to look)

650
00:22:27,660 --> 00:22:28,620
(Turns to look again)

651
00:22:28,660 --> 00:22:29,620
(Turns to look a third time)

652
00:22:29,840 --> 00:22:31,160
(Turns to look a fourth time)
Showtime.

653
00:22:31,720 --> 00:22:32,840
(Jumps up immediately)
Greeters, let's go.

654
00:22:32,840 --> 00:22:34,120
Greeters, let's go.

655
00:22:34,180 --> 00:22:35,600
(Steps right over)
He got up there in just a few strides.

656
00:22:38,300 --> 00:22:39,700
(Big strides)

657
00:22:39,720 --> 00:22:40,560
Look how eager he is.

658
00:22:41,320 --> 00:22:42,240
Hi.

659
00:22:42,240 --> 00:22:42,800
Now he's really trying.

660
00:22:42,800 --> 00:22:43,800
Hi.

661
00:22:44,200 --> 00:22:44,920
Hi.

662
00:22:45,720 --> 00:22:47,040
Hi.

663
00:22:47,040 --> 00:22:48,560
Walk in and everyone's at your service.

664
00:22:49,420 --> 00:22:51,140
(Straightens his clothes)

665
00:22:51,180 --> 00:22:52,980
(Slowly approaches)

666
00:22:53,000 --> 00:22:54,800
(Watching closely)
He looks like he doesn't care at all.

667
00:22:54,800 --> 00:22:55,480
He just walked over.

668
00:22:58,520 --> 00:22:58,800
Hi.

669
00:22:58,800 --> 00:22:59,320
Your shoes.

670
00:22:59,380 --> 00:23:00,260
(Takes her shoes)

671
00:23:02,120 --> 00:23:02,680
Where's your suitcase?

672
00:23:03,240 --> 00:23:04,320
It's downstairs.

673
00:23:04,320 --> 00:23:05,240
We'll go get it for you.

674
00:23:05,240 --> 00:23:05,760
(In sync)
We'll go.

675
00:23:05,760 --> 00:23:06,320
Thanks.

676
00:23:06,320 --> 00:23:07,400
(Another volunteer)
How many suitcases do you have?

677
00:23:07,400 --> 00:23:08,120
One.

678
00:23:09,080 --> 00:23:09,560
Okay.

679
00:23:10,520 --> 00:23:11,360
One suitcase.

680
00:23:11,360 --> 00:23:12,960
But there are several guys here.

681
00:23:12,960 --> 00:23:13,560
How about this?

682
00:23:13,560 --> 00:23:14,680
Rock, paper, scissors.

683
00:23:14,680 --> 00:23:15,920
The winner carries it one step.

684
00:23:18,500 --> 00:23:20,140
(Moves closer)

685
00:23:20,160 --> 00:23:21,200
Sun Bohan's definitely going all out.

686
00:23:23,500 --> 00:23:24,660
(Observing)

687
00:23:27,560 --> 00:23:28,880
Let's go. The three of us.

688
00:23:28,880 --> 00:23:30,000
If it's really heavy, the three of us

689
00:23:30,000 --> 00:23:30,560
can figure out

690
00:23:30,560 --> 00:23:31,120
how to carry it.

691
00:23:31,640 --> 00:23:32,560
One corner each. Perfect.

692
00:23:32,860 --> 00:23:33,480
(One corner each)

693
00:23:33,480 --> 00:23:34,160
That's true.

694
00:23:34,640 --> 00:23:35,920
It has four wheels. There's one extra.

695
00:23:36,280 --> 00:23:38,800
They're seriously thinking this through.

696
00:23:38,800 --> 00:23:40,880
The three of us can take
ten seconds each.

697
00:23:41,320 --> 00:23:43,000
Ten seconds each.

698
00:23:43,000 --> 00:23:44,040
They're all fighting to do it.

699
00:23:45,500 --> 00:23:47,580
(Watching closely)

700
00:23:48,320 --> 00:23:48,640
Right.

701
00:23:48,640 --> 00:23:50,000
Should these shoes go in the cabinet?

702
00:23:50,160 --> 00:23:51,240
(Steps forward)
Look, here he comes.

703
00:23:51,240 --> 00:23:52,400
I'm here.

704
00:23:56,280 --> 00:23:56,920
Let me take a look.

705
00:24:00,320 --> 00:24:01,240
Hi, everyone.

706
00:24:01,240 --> 00:24:02,360
Hi.

707
00:24:02,840 --> 00:24:04,200
You can check out the rooms later.

708
00:24:05,160 --> 00:24:05,520
Yeah.

709
00:24:05,520 --> 00:24:07,520
We have rooms upstairs.

710
00:24:07,520 --> 00:24:09,120
Those two already decided.

711
00:24:09,520 --> 00:24:10,520
What are you thinking?

712
00:24:10,690 --> 00:24:11,420
(Pays attention)
What am I thinking?

713
00:24:11,440 --> 00:24:12,360
I was thinking

714
00:24:12,360 --> 00:24:12,640
maybe

715
00:24:12,640 --> 00:24:14,200
I shouldn't room with you two.

716
00:24:14,200 --> 00:24:15,360
I get up really early.

717
00:24:15,360 --> 00:24:17,040
I have to get up at four or five.

718
00:24:17,240 --> 00:24:19,360
I'm worried I'll wake you up.

719
00:24:20,720 --> 00:24:22,160
He keeps circling around her.

720
00:24:22,640 --> 00:24:23,440
Wanna take a lap?

721
00:24:24,340 --> 00:24:25,880
(A beat behind)
Let's go check out the rooms.

722
00:24:26,540 --> 00:24:28,620
(Hesitates)

723
00:24:30,040 --> 00:24:31,040
Well...

724
00:24:31,040 --> 00:24:32,880
Didn't we say we'd go together?

725
00:24:32,880 --> 00:24:33,480
You know...

726
00:24:34,000 --> 00:24:35,680
Can I go check out the rooms?

727
00:24:35,680 --> 00:24:37,000
I haven't seen them either.

728
00:24:38,760 --> 00:24:39,800
You...

729
00:24:39,800 --> 00:24:41,240
Have no principles.

730
00:24:41,240 --> 00:24:43,060
(Speaking for me)
What perfect timing.

731
00:24:43,460 --> 00:24:44,400
(That's brilliant)

732
00:24:44,400 --> 00:24:45,480
So adaptable.

733
00:24:45,480 --> 00:24:45,880
Let's go.

734
00:24:45,880 --> 00:24:46,280
Let's go together.

735
00:24:46,280 --> 00:24:46,880
Let's all look.

736
00:24:46,880 --> 00:24:47,720
Is this your suitcase?

737
00:24:48,240 --> 00:24:48,560
That's not mine.

738
00:24:48,560 --> 00:24:49,200
This one's mine.

739
00:24:49,200 --> 00:24:50,440
I left it here.

740
00:24:50,440 --> 00:24:51,440
They went to get it.

741
00:24:52,040 --> 00:24:53,400
Those kind souls are getting it for me.

742
00:24:53,400 --> 00:24:54,640
I'll wait for them.

743
00:24:54,640 --> 00:24:55,640
(Follows along)
Then I'll go upstairs.

744
00:24:56,200 --> 00:24:57,240
Instant follow mode.

745
00:24:59,440 --> 00:25:00,560
Here.

746
00:25:00,560 --> 00:25:01,840
(Kind souls)

747
00:25:01,840 --> 00:25:02,880
Let's test how heavy it is first.

748
00:25:02,880 --> 00:25:03,520
Let's test it first.

749
00:25:05,180 --> 00:25:05,860
(Lift it together)

750
00:25:05,880 --> 00:25:06,680
No, it's not that heavy.

751
00:25:06,680 --> 00:25:07,600
It's fine.

752
00:25:08,260 --> 00:25:09,340
(A hand suddenly appears)

753
00:25:11,340 --> 00:25:12,100
(Takes the suitcase)

754
00:25:13,640 --> 00:25:14,600
These three...

755
00:25:14,600 --> 00:25:16,160
What are they competing over?

756
00:25:16,160 --> 00:25:17,700
(Reaches out)

757
00:25:18,300 --> 00:25:19,260
(Grabs it)

758
00:25:19,260 --> 00:25:20,440
Everyone gets a turn.

759
00:25:20,440 --> 00:25:21,640
We'll each carry it for a bit.
I'll take the first half.

760
00:25:21,640 --> 00:25:22,860
(Loses his grip again)
Okay.

761
00:25:25,420 --> 00:25:26,060
(Lifts)

762
00:25:28,100 --> 00:25:28,940
(Drags)

763
00:25:30,980 --> 00:25:32,140
(Supports it)

764
00:25:33,880 --> 00:25:34,960
They're so cute.

765
00:25:36,300 --> 00:25:37,060
(Stares)

766
00:25:37,080 --> 00:25:38,000
He keeps staring.

767
00:25:38,060 --> 00:25:39,080
(Stares at the suitcase)

768
00:25:39,080 --> 00:25:40,160
Here, I'll take this part.

769
00:25:40,900 --> 00:25:42,140
(Takes it)

770
00:25:42,140 --> 00:25:43,000
Yeah, you take it.

771
00:25:46,160 --> 00:25:47,000
Way too fair.

772
00:25:47,000 --> 00:25:48,040
They're so well-behaved.

773
00:25:49,660 --> 00:25:50,560
(Trips)
What happened?

774
00:25:50,940 --> 00:25:51,980
(At the same time)
Take it slow.

775
00:25:54,040 --> 00:25:57,000
Thank you.

776
00:25:57,000 --> 00:25:58,360
(Follows)
Thank you so much.

777
00:25:59,040 --> 00:26:00,160
Thanks for the help.

778
00:26:02,740 --> 00:26:03,980
(Observing)

779
00:26:05,620 --> 00:26:06,240
(Steps forward)
Look.

780
00:26:06,240 --> 00:26:07,520
I'll leave this suitcase downstairs.

781
00:26:07,520 --> 00:26:08,720
(Takes it away)
Thanks.

782
00:26:08,720 --> 00:26:09,320
And then,

783
00:26:09,320 --> 00:26:11,160
the girls' rooms are upstairs.

784
00:26:11,160 --> 00:26:12,280
He picked it right up.

785
00:26:15,820 --> 00:26:16,660
(Moves it inside)

786
00:26:17,660 --> 00:26:18,540
(Hands on hips)

787
00:26:18,560 --> 00:26:20,760
He only helps when she can see him.

788
00:26:20,760 --> 00:26:21,520
Yeah, he's such a

789
00:26:21,520 --> 00:26:23,000
dramatic big kid.

790
00:26:24,720 --> 00:26:27,200
Let's go upstairs
and check out the rooms.

791
00:26:27,200 --> 00:26:27,600
Okay.

792
00:26:27,600 --> 00:26:28,120
Let's go.

793
00:26:28,120 --> 00:26:29,160
Here's his chance.

794
00:26:29,160 --> 00:26:30,200
Do you know the way?

795
00:26:30,200 --> 00:26:31,640
Let's go up this way.

796
00:26:31,640 --> 00:26:32,120
Sure.

797
00:26:32,840 --> 00:26:34,160
You've all seen the rooms?

798
00:26:34,160 --> 00:26:35,040
Yeah, we have.

799
00:26:35,040 --> 00:26:36,120
Then I'll go take a look.

800
00:26:36,120 --> 00:26:36,720
Okay.

801
00:26:37,240 --> 00:26:38,520
Let's go. I haven't been up either.

802
00:26:38,520 --> 00:26:39,320
Okay.

803
00:26:39,800 --> 00:26:40,640
Perfect timing.

804
00:26:41,000 --> 00:26:42,280
How many "perfect timings" can there be?

805
00:26:44,920 --> 00:26:45,640
Guys.

806
00:26:48,320 --> 00:26:50,040
Where can I put this bag?

807
00:26:50,040 --> 00:26:50,320
Give it to me.

808
00:26:50,320 --> 00:26:50,920
I'll put it away for you.

809
00:26:50,920 --> 00:26:51,600
Thanks.

810
00:26:52,380 --> 00:26:55,620
(Watching closely)

811
00:26:56,920 --> 00:26:57,960
I just got here.

812
00:26:57,960 --> 00:26:59,080
What time is it?

813
00:26:59,080 --> 00:27:00,200
Look at the time.

814
00:27:00,200 --> 00:27:01,560
I don't even know what time it is.

815
00:27:01,560 --> 00:27:03,040
I got here last.

816
00:27:03,040 --> 00:27:03,520
No.

817
00:27:03,520 --> 00:27:04,760
I think

818
00:27:04,760 --> 00:27:06,080
Yu Yang and Cui Kaiyi still aren't here.

819
00:27:06,080 --> 00:27:06,600
Right.

820
00:27:07,280 --> 00:27:08,000
A whole houseful.

821
00:27:10,380 --> 00:27:12,980
(Notices)
Should we take the suitcase upstairs?

822
00:27:13,000 --> 00:27:14,200
Whose suitcase is this?

823
00:27:14,640 --> 00:27:17,000
This is Sun Bohan's suitcase.

824
00:27:17,520 --> 00:27:18,760
Sun Bohan can carry his own.

825
00:27:21,200 --> 00:27:22,360
Yeah, I can't carry this one.

826
00:27:22,360 --> 00:27:23,360
(Even suitcases need boundaries)
Right?

827
00:27:23,880 --> 00:27:24,880
That's hilarious.

828
00:27:25,520 --> 00:27:26,800
Sun Bohan can carry his own.

829
00:27:26,800 --> 00:27:27,520
Help her (Sha Yue'er).

830
00:27:27,520 --> 00:27:28,960
Yeah, help carry
her suitcase (upstairs).

831
00:27:28,960 --> 00:27:30,620
(Picks it up)

832
00:27:30,660 --> 00:27:34,140
(Carries it off first)

833
00:27:34,580 --> 00:27:36,740
(Looks)

834
00:27:37,380 --> 00:27:41,140
(Strains)

835
00:27:41,160 --> 00:27:42,320
Whose is this?

836
00:27:42,320 --> 00:27:43,760
This is

837
00:27:43,760 --> 00:27:44,360
Sha Yue'er's.

838
00:27:45,580 --> 00:27:47,100
(Takes it back)

839
00:27:50,460 --> 00:27:51,660
(Sun Bohan's suitcase)

840
00:27:55,280 --> 00:27:56,000
What just happened?

841
00:27:56,480 --> 00:27:57,560
Wu Siying looks totally confused.

842
00:27:57,560 --> 00:27:59,160
What are you guys doing?

843
00:28:05,640 --> 00:28:06,880
Wiping off the suitcase (mark).

844
00:28:11,560 --> 00:28:13,000
I brought your suitcase up.

845
00:28:13,000 --> 00:28:13,560
This is...

846
00:28:13,560 --> 00:28:14,240
Thanks.

847
00:28:14,240 --> 00:28:15,720
And Sun Bohan, yours is behind me.

848
00:28:16,400 --> 00:28:17,440
Okay, leave it here.

849
00:28:17,720 --> 00:28:18,600
Let me catch my (breath).

850
00:28:19,400 --> 00:28:20,160
That suitcase is pretty heavy.

851
00:28:21,840 --> 00:28:22,880
Maybe it's not really heavy.

852
00:28:24,420 --> 00:28:25,020
(Joins the tour)

853
00:28:25,040 --> 00:28:26,040
This one's already

854
00:28:26,040 --> 00:28:27,320
been picked.

855
00:28:27,620 --> 00:28:28,960
(Wu Siying, Liang Renfang)
The girls' room.

856
00:28:28,960 --> 00:28:29,920
Go take a look.

857
00:28:31,080 --> 00:28:32,040
(Signal House, Room 901)
It's so cool in here.

858
00:28:32,040 --> 00:28:32,980
(Green double room)
Room 901.

859
00:28:33,100 --> 00:28:34,860
(Watching closely)

860
00:28:36,580 --> 00:28:37,940
(Looks around)

